# Rivox — Agentic Goal Content Validation

## Rule

Any code that surfaces **open-knowledge articles**, **resolved goal topics**, or **generation topics** for org/domain goals (e.g. `elsai.ai`) **MUST** pass through `GoalContentValidationAgent` in `lib/core/services/agentic/goal_content_validation_agent.dart`.

Do **not** call `OrgContentValidator` directly from feature code — the agent wraps deterministic rules and optional LLM review.

## Pipeline (fail closed)

1. **Deterministic** — `OrgContentValidator` + `TopicGoalRelevanceGate` (person-name drift, biography hints, off-goal topics).
2. **Agent** (org goals, borderline only) — lightweight LLM JSON `{approved, reason}` via `skipQuota: true`.
3. **Fallback** — `GoalTopicResolver.deterministicFallback(goal)` when validation fails; never show unvalidated Wikipedia/topic.

## Required call sites

| Flow | Method |
|------|--------|
| Wikipedia / daily pack article | `validateOpenKnowledgeArticle` |
| Quiz / path / daily topic string | `validateGenerationTopic` |
| After `GoalTopicResolver.resolve` | `ensureValidResolved` |
| Before caching resolved goal | same |

## Regression cases (must stay rejected)

- `elsai.ai` → Wikipedia **Elsaid Maher** (person, not company)
- Stale weak topics (Islamic history, biomedical) when goal is an org domain
- Quiz/path effective topic that is a person name similar to brand

## Tests

Add cases to `test/org_content_validator_test.dart` and `test/goal_content_validation_agent_test.dart` for every new rejection heuristic.

Log changes in `docs/logs/BUGFIX_LOG.md` + `docs/PROJECT_LOG.md`.
